SUMMARY:Jerry's Dead Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:\nCelebrate the songbook of Jerry Garcia with Jerry’s Dead 
 at French Broad River Brewery! Brought to you by Tim Marsh on guitar\, Dan
  Pederson on bass\, Gus Vigo on the keys and Lee Kram on drums. Each and e
 very week celebrates the spirt of the Grateful Dead with a unique set list
  and a faithful community of dead heads in attendance\, turning our taproo
 m into a haven for Deadheads and music lovers alike\, every Thursday! \n\n
 \n\nCheck it out on our Instagram!\n\n\n\nhttps://jerrysdead.com\n\n\n\nTh
 is is a free show\, with no cover charge. Our taproom is family and dog fr
 iendly! \n
