 08-2026-08-03-2026-10-10/
SUMMARY:Jazz Brunch
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for Jazz Brunch Saturdays from 11:30 AM - 2:30 PM!\n\
 n\n\nSaturdays just got a whole lot more exciting here in the taproom! We 
 hope y’all will all join us for some jazzzzy\, mid-day spring/summer tap
 room vibes. We’ll have an extra special brunch menu\, craft beer\, mimos
 as\, and of course\, beer-mosas\, all alongside jazz music from the talent
 ed jazz fusion trio\, “Four Peanuts”.\n\n\n\nThe group explores both o
 riginal compositions and zesty covers of tunes you may or may not know. Th
 e trio features Alex Taub on keyboards\, Brennan Dugan on bass\, and Joe E
 nright on drums\, and will certainly leave your peanuts salted and boiled 
 to perfection!\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.frenchbroadbrewery.com/wp-content/up
 loads/2026/04/Jazz-Brunch-Flyer-Menu-Real-Estate-Flyer-scaled.png
