 26-10-11/
SUMMARY:Reggae Sunday with Chalwa
DESCRIPTION:\nFeel the Island Vibes at Reggae Sunday!\n\n\n\nChalwa&nbsp\;R
 eggae Sunday at French Broad River Brewery happens every week from 3pm-6pm
 ! It’s the perfect way to round out each weekend. You’ll find yourself
  drifting away to the sounds of reggae music surrounded by good people and
  great beer. Reggae Sunday is fun for the whole family!&nbsp\;\n\n\n\nThis
  8-member Mountain Reggae powerhouse packs it full of roots meditations an
 d high grade jams that awaken your spirit and soul! Chalwa’s high energy
  shows are one of a kind\, featuring smooth vocals\, percussion\, bass\, l
 ead guitar\, keys and saxophone. Their extensive collection of original mu
 sic is interlaced with music from some of the Greats including\, Bob Marle
 y\, Peter Tosh\, Burning Spear\, Bunny Wailer and even Jerry Garcia and th
 e Grateful Dead.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/5mwa3DcMn99Knp4X
 vY2WY4?si=hXOTX8oQSwicEsDtfHToeQ\nCheck out Chalwa on Spotify! \n\n\n\nFre
 nch Broad River Brewery is family and dog friendly\, proudly serving our d
 elicious craft beer and seltzer as well as a additional selection of local
  cider\, wine and non-alcoholic options. French Broad River Pizza will als
 o be serving up fresh made pies and slices\, as well as other snacks\, sal
 ads\, wraps and sandwiches.\n\n\n\nThis is a free show\, with no cover cha
 rge. Our taproom is family and dog friendly!\n\n\n\nWhy Reggae Sunday Rock
 s:\n\n\n\n\nLive Reggae Music: CHALWA\, an 8-member reggae powerhouse\, de
 livers roots meditations and high-energy jams that will move your spirit a
 nd soul. Enjoy original tracks and classics from legends like Bob Marley\,
  Peter Tosh\, and the Grateful Dead.\n\n\n\nAll Ages &amp\; Pet-Friendly: 
 Bring the whole family\, including your furry friends\, for an afternoon o
 f fun.\n\n\n\nNo Cover Charge: Enjoy the music without any entry fee.\n\n\
 n\nTaproom Selection: Choose from craft beers on draft\, local ciders\, ha
 rd seltzers\, wines\, non-alcoholic beer\, and sodas.\n\n\n\nDelicious Piz
 za: Savor fresh\, hand-tossed pizza from French Broad River Pizza\, availa
 ble daily in the taproom. View the menu.\n\n\n\n\nCome experience the perf
 ect blend of music\, vibes\, and community every Sunday at French Broad Ri
 ver Brewery!\n\n\n\n[instagram-feed feed=5]\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.frenchbroadbrewery.com/wp-content/up
